>
> I thought Lojban didn't allow three-consonant clusters?

Three-consonant clusters are common in lujvo. In fu'ivla,
you can have up to four consonant clusters (at least in
one proposed morphology, this matter is still not settled.)
If you count vocalic consonants you can get monsters
like {cidjrspageti} too.

